# Nessian Hornbeetle, a 2/2: "At the beginning of combat on your turn, if you control another creature with power 4 or greater, put a
# +1/+1 counter on this creature." An intervening "if" (CR 603.4): asked as combat begins and again on resolution.
# Turn 1: Bot1 controls a Hill Giant (power 3, just short): no counter. Turn 2: Bot2 casts an Alpine Grizzly (power 4, but an opponent's):
# turn 3 still no counter. Turn 3 main 2: Bot1 casts its own Alpine Grizzly. Turn 5: power 4 exactly, so one counter (a 3/3), however
# many qualify. Turn 7: Bot2 answers the trigger with a Lightning Bolt on that Grizzly, so the condition fails on resolution: no
# second counter.

